+    - Real chunks win inside their ring: the LOD fragment shader discards pixels over a chunk the ring covers (same `dx*dx+dz*dz <= r*r` as the mesher's ring), so nothing is rebuilt when the player walks. Crack between two levels: skirts (outer side faces down to y = 0). `lib.rs`: LOD drawn after the chunks in the same pass, camera `zfar` = `lod::FAR`, terrain fog distance = `lod::RADIUS`, not drawn under water.
