+    - UNVERIFIED: that it compiles; `lod_follows_the_terrain` (mean error < 4 blocks vs the real chunk surface is a guess); brightness vs the chunk shader (sRGB handled by `pow(2.2)`); tile cost (~13 ms estimated: 18 x 18 x 17 nodes x 3 noise stacks); 1024 radius and `SPLIT` 2.0 on a phone; `vl.rs` with `zfar` 1280 (it clamps its own use at 512).
